    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάμβδα</span></b> , or
		better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάβδα</span></b>  (v. sub voc.),
			τό, indecl., twelfth (later
		eleventh) letter of the Gr. alphabet: as numeral <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ́</span>
		=
		<i><span class="en">
			30
		</span></i>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			l'
		</span>
		=
		<i><span class="en">
			30
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			000
		</span></i>.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
